BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fall Color Hike: Lake Strahl\, Brown County State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261006T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261006T134500
UID:4cbc82b29ab4b5849c223119c666a41b@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for a guided hike of Trail 6 around Lak
 e Strahl! Hear about the history of the lake\, the surrounding Strahl Vall
 ey\, and learn about the animals that make it their home\, all while enjoy
 ing beautiful fall colors. The section of Trail 6 around Lake Strahl is co
 nsidered easy to moderate. It has some short staircases\, uneven surfaces\
 , tree roots\, and possible&nbsp\; wet spots. The trail is less than a mil
 e and will take about 45 minutes to complete. Meet at the Lake Strahl park
 ing lot.
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Lake Strahl parking lot\, 1405 S.R. 46 
 W\, Nashville\, IN 
URL:https://on.in.gov/BrownCountySP
X-SOURCE:Brown County State Park
